#######
# Muls Dexxer Bot Config - PvP profile
# Based on Ultimate Dexxer Bot Rewrite 2024-2025 by Jaseowns
# Init and base bot files are NOT compatible.
# All original variables have been renamed for consistency and to avoid weird compatibility issues
# DO NOT ask jaseowns for support for this bot.
# This is my own fork adding my own features and optimizations along with new config variables.
#
# PvP-only config - vars for features that don't survive structured PvP
# (Chivalry, parry stance switching, tracking) or that are out of scope for
# a PvP profile (Taming, Bard, Skinning) are not here. See mbot_pvp_base.razor
# for what was removed.
#######

removelist mbot_PreviousScript
createlist mbot_PreviousScript
pushlist mbot_PreviousScript "Play Script: Combat\Dexxer\mbot_pvp_base"

@setvar! mconfig_General_ShowVersion 0

# Smart Equip Features
@setvar! mconfig_SmartEquip_RunOnce 1
@setvar! mconfig_Weapon_SmartEquip 1
@setvar! mconfig_Shield_SmartEquip 1

# Warning overhead if pouch popped
@setvar! mconfig_Thief_AlertRedPouchPop 1

# Auto-activates Frost armor aspect
@setvar! mconfig_Aspect_AutoActivateFrost 0

# Self-Bandaging
@setvar! mconfig_Healing_AutoBandageHpDiffTrigger 1

# Cure/Heal Potions
@setvar! mconfig_Potion_UseCureAutomatically 1
@setvar! mconfig_Potion_CureHpDiffTrigger 5
@setvar! mconfig_Potion_UseHealAutomatically 1
@setvar! mconfig_Potion_HealHpDiffTrigger 20

# Buff Potions
@setvar! mconfig_Potion_UseAgilityAutomatically 1
@setvar! mconfig_Potion_UseStrengthAutomatically 1
@setvar! mconfig_Potion_UseMagicResistAutomatically 1
@setvar! mconfig_Potion_UseMagicResistAgainIfDebuffedAutomatically 1

# Auto Weapon Poison Application
@setvar! mconfig_Poison_AutomaticallyApply 1

# Cycles target to next red player (target only, no attack)
@setvar! mconfig_Target_AutoTargetMurdererPlayer 0

@setvar! mconfig_Healing_AidCountAlertLessThan20 1

if listexists mbot_PreviousScript
    foreach myScript in mbot_PreviousScript
        hotkey myScript
    endfor
endif
